 t\; while someone removes a glove to it. Date &amp\; Time: Sunday\, Septem
 ber 13th | 12:00 PM Location: Granite Brewery (245 Eglinton Ave E\, Toront
 o) Tickets: $15 Early Bird\, $20 GA Menu: A curated brunch buffet featurin
 g all your favourite items! The buffet includes coffee/tea\, salads and de
 ssert! NOTE: Brunch is not included in your ticket price. A $25 minimum sp
 end is required\, and a 18% gratuity will be applied to all bills Age Requ
 irement: This show is 18+ Cast: Sucka Queen\, Newfoundlad\, Jessie James\,
  and Zaira Cruz! Get ready for a one-of-a-kind Drag Brunch Bingo experienc
 e at Granite Brewery! Expect high-energy drag performances\, hilarious bin
