DESCRIPTION:Queer cocktail night featuring social Bingo mixer\, color code
 d wristbands and games. Who&#x27\;s ready to mingle? Save water\, drink co
 cktails✨🍹 Queer Mingle invites you to an incredible evening at The Dr
 ake Hotel! Come mingle\, make new friends\, and enjoy a drink with us\, ga
 mes will be available to play. Start the night off with our Social Bingo m
 ixer and get to meet everyone. If you&#x27\;re in the mood for a little ex
 tra fun\, show your relationship status by wearing a provided colour wrist
 band. 🔴 Red = Stop! I&#x27\;m taken 🟡Yellow = It&#x27\;s complicated
  but open to flirting 🟢Green = I&#x27\;m single &amp\; ready to [queer]
  mingle ⚪ White = I&#x27\;m Poly and looking to explore 🔵 Blue = Just
  looking to make friends Queer Cocktail Night will take place in the styli
 sh Modern Wing Lobby + Living Room of The Drake Hotel! Indulge in an incre
 dible variety of cocktails\, beer\, wine\, and tantalizing appetizers like
  cheese boards and sushi. It&#x27\;s the perfect setting to unwind\, socia
 lize\, and enjoy delicious treats in a welcoming atmosphere. Who&#x27\;s r
 eady to mingle? Location: The Drake Hotel’s Modern Wing Lobby + Living R
 oom 1150 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6J 1J3 Time : 6:00pm - 11:30pm Tickets
 : $15 online\, $20 cash at the door Limited number of early bird tickets a
 vailable! $10 *This location is fully accessible and offers gender-neutral
  bathrooms ‍
LOCATION:The Drake Hotel\, 1150 Queen St West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-cocktail-night
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
