BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SCENE STEALER by Midas
DTSTART:20260918T190000
DTEND:20260918T190000
UID:08289d7a233a7d4730cda9d37b8d7d0f@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:I AM PRODUCING MY FIRST EVER PRODUCTION EVENT INTRODUCING SCEN
 E STEALER Every month I will bring in four contestants to steal the spotli
 ght. Each contestant will prepare a production number based on the theme a
 nd it’s up to YOU who will reign supreme. This month we’re falling in 
 love at first sight! The winner will walk away with an extra $100 based on
  audience vote. WHO WILL BE THE… SCENE STEALER SEPTEMBER 18TH DOORS @ 7P
 M SHOW @ 8PM SHARP With a Scene Stealer ticket purchase you will get free 
 admission into Slur Tickets available at … I am beyond excited to bring 
 Scene Stealer to the village! Thank you so much to @buddies for trusting m
 e with the space! My goal with Scene Stealer is to bring more opportunitie
 s for production drag to the village. I want each performer more than anyt
 hing to bring a number they are passionate about\, one they wouldn’t be 
 able to do on a regular night. Huge shout out to Booty Cornfed for all you
 r help with logistics\, would not be possible without you! LIGHTS\, CAMERA
 \, ACTION Like its ambisextrous namesake\, Buddies’ in-house bar and per
 formance space Tallulah’s Cabaret does it all. It’s throbbing club nig
 hts and community tap dance lessons. High-concept drag and low-stakes open
  mics. Go for pre-drinks but stay late for the post-show discourse—maybe
  even spark that next collaboration. With local brews and sober options th
 at aren’t an after-thought\, Tallulah’s is the come-as-you-are bar for
  old friends\, new lovers\, partiers\, poets\, and curious passerby. See y
 ou under the chandeliers. ‍
LOCATION:Buddies in Bad Times\, 12 Alexander St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/scene-stealer-by-midas
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
