BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LOVE ONLY W/ Detroit legend Mike Grant and Kiki LeFreak
DTSTART:20260919T220000
DTEND:20260919T220000
UID:41b4b4bf0926700c7fbdb1f5babf0329@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:LOVE ONLY is a new event series brought to you by Kiki LeFreak
  every month at Bambi’s To start things off right we have a very special
  guest dj from Detroit. He is a pioneer in house and techno. The one and o
 nly MIKE GRANT! Mike Grant is a Detroit-based DJ\, producer\, and owner of
  Moods &amp\; Grooves Records\, whose career has helped shape the global s
 ound of house and techno. Active since the early 1980s\, he was part of th
 e WJLB “Street Beat” radio show alongside Juan Atkins and Derrick May\
 , became the first American DJ to hold a residency at Berlin’s legendary
  Tresor Club\, one of the first DJs to have their mixes played for dancers
  on TV (WGPR’s The Scene including Jeff Mills)\, and has been featured i
 n the Detroit Historical Museum’s “Techno: Detroit’s Gift to the Wor
 ld” exhibit. His iconic track “The Struggle of My People” was includ
 ed in Resident Advisor’s Best Electronic Records of 2000–25\, affirmin
 g Grant’s lasting global impact. As founder of the influential Moods &am
 p\; Grooves record label\, his work remains deeply rooted in Detroit and r
 espected worldwide. Supported by Toronto local favourite Kiki LeFreak! Hou
 se Techno New wave Disco 10pm to LATE Bambi’s 1265 Dundas st west ‍
LOCATION:Bambi&#x27\;s\, 1265 Dundas Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/love-only-w-detroit-legend-mike-grant-and-
 kiki-lefreak
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Odd Kid Club Vol.2___ Emphatic Dance Music &lt\;3
DTSTART:20260919T220000
DTEND:20260919T220000
UID:2a9de857e86b67de481913485ece39fd@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:/lineup @KushArora aka Only Now digital polyglot Melonwater ju
 jube orkid @murderclub Odd Kid Club returns for Vol. 2 — a night of emph
 atic dance music for odd kids and kindred spirits\, unfolding inside a sec
 ret Toronto space. From emotion\, through music\, back to you. Same warm e
 nergy\, same open dance floor. Come ready for deep bass\, bold sounds\, an
 d wherever the night takes us. This time\, we welcome Only Now\, the live 
 project of Bay Area producer Kush Arora. Having performed at MUTEK and ear
 ned recognition from The Wire\, FACT\, and XLR8R\, Kush brings his Indian 
 musical roots into a world of heavy bass and raw electronic sound. Live\, 
 the music moves between intimacy and intensity—sometimes meditative\, so
 metimes explosive\, always made to be felt together. No fixed genre\, no n
 eed to fit in. Come curious\, move freely\, and bring your beautiful weird
 ness. See you in the room &lt\;3 ‍
LOCATION:TBA\, Address TO BE ANNOUNCED
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/odd-kid-club-vol-2-emphatic-dance-music-3
