  jeans got tighter\, the hair got less dramatic\, and the hangovers got wo
 rse... but the need to gather with your friends and scream along never wen
 t away. Introducing: 🖤 MFOB: My Friends Over (drag) Brunch - Emo Drag B
 runch 🖤 Join us at Torontos legendary Sneaky Dee’s on Sunday\, Septem
 ber 20th for a new drag brunch inspired by the era that gave us emo anthem
 s\, basement shows\, band tees\, and friendships that lasted way longer th
 an our favourite bands. Hosted and produced by Jayjay Kings\, as seen on F
 amily Feud Canada and Drag Brunch Saves My Life\, this brunch brings toget
 her a killer lineup of performers: Pop Punk Diva Helena Poison\, Canada’
 s Drag Race\, and Kréme Inakuchi\, drag king and producer of Toronto’s 
 Thrust Fest. 📍Sneaky Dee&#x27\;s Doors: 12:00pm Show: 12:30pm 2 for $20
  (10 pairs only!) $15 (GA) $20 (Last min) *NOTE SNEAKY DEES IS CASH ONLY. 
 WE HAVE AN ATM ON SITE. GIVEAWAY: Every ticket purchased gets entered into
  a draw to win 2 TICKETS to JIMBO RUINS XXXMAS tour in Toronto. Whether yo
 u were at the original MFOY parties or you’re just discovering the magic
