BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Night for Venezuela &amp\; Colombia
DTSTART:20260925T200000
DTEND:20260925T200000
UID:30ec3426f3d1d49348a31dc96f18bc09@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Musical Bingo and Dance Party Fundraiser Join us for a night o
 f music and food\, in solidarity with Venezuela &amp\; Colombia 🇻🇪
 🇨🇴 Veneno Club\, La Rumba Buena\, Sonic Sancocho\, Marikass\, Chang
 ó and CreaTO are coming together to raise funds for organizations working
  on the ground in the neighbouring countries 🤝 Though media coverage an
 d mass donations have decreased\, thousands affected and displaced continu
 e to need support. Let’s make our Toronto community’s love be felt far
  and beyond! ❤️ 🗓️ When and where: Friday\, Sept 25 Cafeteria (16
 50 Dupont St) 8pm to 3am Schedule: 8pm: doors and food 9:30pm: musical bin
 go starts Then we party until 3am! 🎵 Musical Bingo: Latin classics edit
 ion\, hosted by @anzolaloops . Prizes for winners! 🍲 Free sancocho and 
 tamales\, first come first served while supplies last 💿 Music by Nyhtnu
