BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ROMEO
DTSTART:20260925T210000
DTEND:20260925T210000
UID:ae9047cb125130e570409644acd47f34@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:DJs Jeremy Glenn\, Phillippe and special guest Zola (Bodyclock
 ) spin house music all night long. All genders welcome. This one&#x27\;s f
 or the dancers. ‍ ROMEO is a celebration of the turn-of-the-millennium c
 lub scene when dance music started emerging from the shadows and into the 
 sensational club spaces of the early 2000’s (Gate Crasher\, Cream\, Mini
 stry of Sound\, etc.) while still paying homage to classic club scenes fou
 nd in New York\, Chicago (Paradise Garage\, The Warehouse\, The Tunnel).AL
 L GENDERS AND IDENTITIES ARE WELCOME TONIGHT! Residents Phillippe and Jere
 my Glenn spin the sexiest of vocal house\, UK garage\, and global club mus
 ic with extra special guest and BodyClock co-founder and resident ZOLA!Pre
 pare your body and soul for a night of dancing. Ticket at the door only. $
 15 before 10pm ‍ Phillippe is well known for his incredible contribution
  to Toronto’s 2SLGBTQ2+ community including co-founding Toronto’s quee
 r community hub and events organization YOHOMO. Phillippe creates joy on t
 he dancefloor with house vocals and sounds that uplift and help dancers fe
 el liberated. He’s resident DJ at parties like NUNU\, Tapette and For Th
 e Lovers and has opened for legends like David Morales\, The Carry Nation\
 , Folamour\, and Horse Meat Disco to name a select few. Jeremy Glenn has b
 een DJing house and club music since the early 2000’s\, and has produced
 \, recorded\, and remixed records on labels such as We Play House Recordin
 gs\, Classic Recording Company\, Defected\, Future Classic\, and B-Pitch t
 o name a few. Jeremy’s blend of disco\, soulful house\, and deep undergr
 ound cuts have graced the dance floors for parties like A Club Called Rond
 a and Hotnuts\, and in clubs like Panorama Bar and Nitsa Club.
LOCATION:Black Eagle\, 457 Church Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/romeo
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
