 ined a better place with @revuecinema or a better space alongside the Cult
  Classic King of Toronto @meakoopa &#x27\;s DUMPSTER RACOON! Join us for a
  Shadowcast like NO OTHER. Drag Performers will perform spotlight drag per
 formances to all songs for the film\, BUT not first before we spin a wheel
  to RANDOMLY decide who will be playing what roll! Will we be able to make
  it to Prom?! Grab tickets and see! And to celebrate\, Dumpster Raccoon is
